      <clipPath id="flagEnBR"><polygon points="20,0 20,15 0,15"/></clipPath>
      <!-- Each half is clipped from a full, correctly-proportioned flag (not a flag redrawn to fit its
           own half), so the US canton lands in its real top-left corner and the Jack's cross keeps a
           real arm's width, instead of two blocks of colour that happen to look the same from either
           side. The two clip triangles already share the exact diagonal seam -- deliberately no separate
           divider line drawn on top, since an unclipped one bleeds into the wrong corner at this icon's
           small rendered size. -->
